{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばちは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チャイティーにハマっています。\n牛乳入れても美味しいし、\nあの香りが落ち着く〜\nみくにちゃんがくれたんだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みくにちゃん。みくに。みくにん。\nはっしー。色んな呼び方で呼んでるね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、はっしーとは呼んでないね🤓"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"佐々木久美です🦒\nくみてんです🦒"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ6XDZ78J0DB5T80M4DSMT9R","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ6XE0955Y9GD06FYD0DFQJ4","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ6XE1AKXK8TY79KCHV24M5V","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n年々増えてゆくボロ太くんグッズとともに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年もこの季節がやってきました🛖❄️\n2月18日(日)ごご3時〜TBS系「全国ボロいい宿」\n放送されます☺️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年もバナナマンさん、YOUさんと\n4人でご一緒させていただきました😳\nコタツを囲んで、、その一員でいられることが本当に嬉しくて\n5年目、5回目！\nずっと続いて欲しいな〜と思うほど幸せな時間です♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大自然ロジャーさんの心地よいナレーションも大好きで☺️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お宿も心温まるところばかり、！\n今年は乃木坂46の五百城 茉央ちゃん、菅原咲月ちゃんもロケに行ってくれていて、可愛らしい一面を見ることができました🥰"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぽかぽかになる日曜日の午後にぴったりな\n本当に大好きな番組です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ6XE2DFHXQ2C130PZC69A2Q","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nドラマパートもちょっぴり😽"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非、ご覧くださいませ🐈"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ6XE3H30E2YQFAGJ6C2RMCA","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ6XE4N66DC8YZKF1HR1CGDS","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nまつこのと待つ久美"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"👑🍗🚣🌃🗾⛳️🥚\nふふふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではまたね( ˙-˙ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"佐々木久美"}],"source":"archive"}